  "ruleText": "Pas 303.05 Posting Plate. Each operator shall be issued a registration plate that shall be posted in a conspicuous place near the base loading area of each tramway.\n\nSource. #2297, eff 2-7-83; ss by #2704, eff 5-9-84, EXPIRED 5-9-90 (formerly Saf-S 1003.06)\n\nNew. #4862, eff 7-10-90; ss by #6284, eff 7-10-96; ss by #7800, eff 12-11-02, eff 12-11-02, EXPIRED: 12-11-10\n\nNew. #10072, eff 1-11-12; ss by #13429-B, eff 8-6-22 (formerly Pas 303.07)",
